      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(slack): use endsWith instead of includes for _all_ action_id matching",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\n`isBulkActionsBlock()` used substring `includes(\"_all_\")` to detect bulk-action rows. That heuristic is unsafe:\n\n1. **False positives**: IDs like `deploy_all_services` contain `_all_` and were incorrectly removed during confirmation updates.\n2. **No producer contract**: bare `select_all` / `deselect_all` were never namespaced and global suffix rules reserve unrelated IDs.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Add a **private** Slack bulk contract in `extensions/slack/src/bulk-action-ids.ts` (not exported from `api.ts`):\n  - preferred producer marker: `block_id` prefix `openclaw:bulk:`\n  - preferred action IDs: `openclaw:bulk:select_all`, `openclaw:bulk:deselect_all`\n  - immutable internal ID collections (no mutable exported `Set`)\n  - internal producer helper: `buildOpenClawBulkActionsBlock()`\n- `interactions.block-actions.ts`: classify bulk rows via `isSlackBulkActionsBlock()`:\n  - OpenClaw marker + closed IDs (new producers)\n  - legacy bare `select_all` / `deselect_all` pair only (upgrade compatibility)\n  - **no** global `_all` suffix and **no** `deploy_all_services` false positives\n- Add grammar, legacy-upgrade, and whole-path handler regressions.\n\n## Upgrade contract\n\n| Producer shape | Bulk cleanup |\n|---|---|\n| `openclaw:bulk:*` block + closed action IDs | yes (preferred) |\n| bare `select_all` + `deselect_all` row | yes (legacy compatibility) |\n| `deploy_all_services` / `archive_all` / substring `_all_` heuristics | no (intentional fix) |\n\n## Evidence\n\n**Current head:** `d1cac6ab`\n\n**Unit tests:**\n```\npnpm test extensions/slack/src/bulk-action-ids.test.ts\npnpm test extensions/slack/src/monitor/events/interactions.test.ts -t \"bulk|deploy_all_services|legacy bare\"\n→ 16 passed\n```\n\n**Live Slack proof (redacted, workspace channel `C0BGQ1REJ3T`):**\n\n1. **Bulk row removed when last individual control is selected** — message ts `1783746112.698819`\n2. **`deploy_all_services` preserved when another individual row remains** — message ts `1783746090.752499`\n\n**Lint:** oxlint on touched files — clean\n\n## Review\n\n- ClawSweeper gold follow-up addressed: removed speculative public API exports, made ID collections private/immutable, documented legacy upgrade boundary\n- AI-assisted: Yes\n",
        "branch": "fix/slack-bulk-actions-all-endsWith",
        "head_sha": "d1cac6ab24de74569033258b567f3b8eb51400e6",
        "author": "zw-xysk",
